[I] TclX extension to Tcl

[T] Extended Tcl (TclX) is an upwardly compatible extension to Tcl oriented
[T] towards system programming tasks and large application development. It
[T] adds commands for file and process handling, signals, keyed lists,
[T] string processing and debugging.

[U] https://github.com/flightaware/tclx

